---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { business as b } from '../data/site.js';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Notice | Elite Health & Safety"
  description="How Elite Health & Safety Ltd collects and uses personal data on this website, and where to find the privacy policy for Lanyard, our client portal."
  canonical="https://elitehealthandsafety.co.uk/privacy/">

  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy notice"
    lead="How we handle personal data on this website. Last updated 30 August 2026." />

  <section>
    <div class="wrap section-narrow">

      <div class="sec-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Who we are</div>
        <h2>The data controller</h2>
        <p class="lead">This website is operated by <strong>Elite Health &amp; Safety Ltd</strong>,
        registered in Scotland, company number <strong>{b.companyNumber}</strong>, VAT number <strong>{b.vatNumber}</strong>, registered office
        {b.registeredOffice}. We are registered with the Information Commissioner's Office,
        registration number <strong>{b.icoRegistration}</strong>. For any privacy question, or to exercise any of your rights, contact
        <a href={'mailto:' + b.email}>{b.email}</a> or call {b.phoneDisplay}.</p>
      </div>

      <h3>What this notice covers</h3>
      <p>This notice covers your use of <strong>elitehealthandsafety.co.uk</strong>: browsing the
      site and using our contact and compliance-checklist forms. Clients who sign in to
      <strong>Lanyard</strong>, our client portal, are covered by Lanyard's own privacy policy,
      available at <a href="https://app.lanyardsafety.co.uk/privacy-policy.html">app.lanyardsafety.co.uk/privacy-policy.html</a>.</p>

      <h3>The data we collect, and why</h3>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><strong>Enquiry forms</strong>: when you send an enquiry or request the compliance
        checklist we collect the details you give us: typically your name, email address, phone
        number, company and your message. We use them to respond to you and, where you ask about
        our services, to follow up. Lawful basis: our legitimate interest in responding to
        enquiries, and steps taken at your request before entering a contract.</li>
        <li><strong>Server logs</strong>: our hosting provider (IONOS SE, in the EU) keeps
        standard web-server logs (IP address, pages requested, browser type) for security and to
        keep the site running. Lawful basis: legitimate interest in operating a secure website.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Cookies</h3>
      <p>This website sets no advertising or analytics cookies and does no cross-site tracking.</p>

      <h3>Who we share data with</h3>
      <p>Form submissions are delivered to us by <strong>Web3Forms</strong>, which processes the
      form contents solely to pass them to our mailbox. Our email and documents run on
      <strong>Microsoft 365</strong>. We do not sell personal data, and we share it only with
      service providers who process it on our instructions, or where the law requires.</p>

      <h3>How long we keep it</h3>
      <p>Enquiry correspondence is kept for as long as needed to deal with your enquiry and for a
      reasonable period afterwards, in line with our data retention schedule. If you become a
      client, records are kept per the retention periods in our client terms.</p>

      <h3>Your rights</h3>
      <p>Under UK GDPR you have the right to access the personal data we hold about you, to have
      it corrected or erased, to restrict or object to its processing, and to data portability
      where applicable. Contact <a href={'mailto:' + b.email}>{b.email}</a> to exercise any of
      these. You also have the right to complain to the Information Commissioner's Office
      (<a href="https://ico.org.uk" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>).</p>

    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
